## Матрица: intent → минимальная цепочка

| Intent | Обязательные фазы | Опционально |
|--------|-------------------|-------------|
| positioning | DISCOVER MARKET, MARKETING PLAN, FRONT CREATIVE | CONTENT PLAN, FRONT IMPLEMENT |
| feature_ui | FRONT VAN, FRONT CREATIVE, FRONT PLAN, FRONT IMPLEMENT, FRONT QA | BACK PLAN если API |
| feature_api | BACK VAN, BACK PLAN, BACK IMPLEMENT, BACK QA | BACK CREATIVE L3+ |
| feature_full | PM PLAN, BACK+FRONT ветки, QA×2 | PM ROADMAP L3+ |
| content | CONTENT PLAN, CONTENT WRITE | SEO CONTENT OPS |
| initiative | PM INIT, PM DISCOVER, PM PLAN, PM BACKLOG | PM ROADMAP L3+ |

Пропуск фазы — только с явной причиной в idea-* (`skipped` + why).

